    "description": {
      "value": "<p>一个微小的益处反映出你那出人意料的好运。你获得<a draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.feats-all.Item.Zxh8VEiQwezfcnvk\" data-id=\"Zxh8VEiQwezfcnvk\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"dnd5e_classpack.feats-all\" data-tooltip=\"特性 物品\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;cursor:pointer;background:rgb(221, 221, 221);padding:1px 4px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-dark-tertiary);border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:Signika, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" class=\"content-link\">幸运</a>，<a draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.feats-all.Item.MhLJXPly0B8FEuFW\" data-id=\"MhLJXPly0B8FEuFW\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"dnd5e_classpack.feats-all\" data-tooltip=\"特性 物品\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;cursor:pointer;background:rgb(221, 221, 221);padding:1px 4px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-dark-tertiary);border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:Signika, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" class=\"content-link\">魔法学徒</a>，或者<a draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.feats-all.Item.sYRjltuR7nYyIMOg\" data-id=\"sYRjltuR7nYyIMOg\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"dnd5e_classpack.feats-all\" data-tooltip=\"特性 物品\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;cursor:pointer;background:rgb(221, 221, 221);padding:1px 4px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-dark-tertiary);border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:Signika, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" class=\"content-link\">熟习</a>专长（由你选择）。你所选择的专长即反映了改变了你生活的变化。与某位给予你三个愿望的巨灵的邂逅可能导致了由魔法学徒专长所展现的魔法力量。如果你以一次偶然的三龙牌局偿清了你所有的家庭债务，则可能代之以幸运专长。要不然就是，你可以用熟习专长来反映出你为争取到崭新命运，以及塑造由改变了你生活的力量所赐予的知识与能力而经受的各种考验。</p>",
